    "Consent is refused for the following works: T1 (Lawson Cypress) - fell to ground level, grind out stump and replace.\r\n\r\nInsufficient evidence has been provided to confirm that the tree is the direct or indirect cause of damage to the boundary wall. The submitted reports do not conclusively demonstrate that the root system of T1 is responsible for the structural movement, nor that alternative remedial actions, such as root pruning, have been adequately considered. The tree is protected under TPO 29/04, and its removal cannot be justified on the basis of the information provided."
